      "Bounded local functionality; no automatic promotion of formal CPG qualification.",
      "Original Tensat analysis/single-rule guarded rewriting/greedy extraction is executed through a bounded CPU compatibility driver; this is not qualification of its complete original model CLI, GPU runtime, multi-pattern rules or paper benchmarks",
      "The referenced GPU TASO fork and actual CPU TASO source are separately pinned; BatchNorm API adapters are present for compilation but BN semantics are not qualified",
      "Independent exact-integer oracle evaluates original/expected/extracted expression semantics; no unrestricted IEEE floating-point proof or full exported-TASO graph inference claim",
      "Native operator-cost values are the original CPU cost-model inputs, not a new end-to-end speedup benchmark; auxiliary core uses AST-size cost",
      "The standalone source bundle passes empty-cache offline dependency resolution; the already recorded actual offline source compile used the same locked bytes, and a second full rebuild of the portable archive was not claimed",
      "No pretrained model weights, model downloads, services, GPU or NPU deployment",
      "The target distribution is reference-build metadata, not an installation allowlist."
